1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:07,305
The Guardian explains that powerful wildfire clouds may be making fires in Europe more dangerous.

2
00:00:07,255 --> 00:00:15,123
These clouds can create strong winds and sometimes lightning, which can spread flames or start new fires.

3
00:00:15,123 --> 00:00:25,961
Experts link the rising risk to climate change and say firefighters may face more unpredictable conditions in France, Spain and beyond.

